# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored), or run `clerk env pull --file .dev.vars`. Use a Clerk *development* instance.
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...
CLERK_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
# Web Push for Nudges. Append a throwaway local pair with `bun scripts/vapid-keys.ts >> .dev.vars`.
VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=B...
VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=...
VAPID_SUBJECT=mailto:you@example.com
# Optional: real Plaid Link against Plaid's Sandbox (README, "Bank Connections locally"). Leave out
# to use the fake Plaid (AI_MODEL=stub) or none. Sandbox keys only: never the production secret.
# PLAID_ENV=sandbox
# PLAID_CLIENT_ID=...
# PLAID_SECRET=...
# BANK_CONNECTION_KEY=...
